The IKernelBuilder interface requires a Services property and a Plugins property of type IKernelBuilderPlugins. I will implement a test double for IKernelBuilder and IKernelBuilderPlugins to use in the tests. Then I will resubmit the tests covering the AddVertexAIGeminiChatCompletion method that calls IServiceProvider.GetService<ILoggerFactory>().

